<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Though coming weak and vile,</l><l>Thou dost my strength assure;</l><l>Thou dost my vileness fully cleanse,</l><l>Till spotless all, and pure.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>’Tis Jesus who confirms</l><l>The blessed work within,</l><l>By adding grace to welcomed grace,</l><l>Where reigned the power of sin.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>And He the witness gives</l><l>To loyal hearts and free,</l><l>That every promise is fulfilled,</l><l>If faith but brings the plea.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>All hail, redeeming blood!</l><l>All hail, life-giving grace!</l><l>All hail, the gift of Christ our Lord,</l><l>Our strength and righteousness.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
